==English==
[[File:Köttbullar i skål.JPG|thumb|Meatballs]]

===Etymology===
[[meat]] + [[ball]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# a [[ball]] of [[minced]] or [[ground]] [[meat]], [[seasoned]] and [[cooked]]
#*1996. ''Mrs. Miracle''. Debbie Macomber. Pg. 101.
#*:I prefer spaghetti with '''meatballs''' instead the meat all crumbled in with the sauce.
# {{context|slang|lang=en}} a [[stupid]] person
# {{context|baseball|lang=en}} an easy pitch to hit, especially thrown right down the middle of the plate.

